paras.en:
From you is the courage of old and young;
from you is the comfort of small and great;
on you is the foundation of the order of the world;
if you are not there, this shop would have no brightness.
Effort at every stage is from you;
bustle in every caravan is from you.

You have favoured many of the helpless;
you have made beggars rich;
you gave power of reach to those who could not reach;
you made the sailors kings.
To Alexander you gave the glory of the Kayanids;
to Columbus you gave a new world.
